["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Extreme Meteorology (EL NIÑO) with Marshall Shepherd ENSO teleconnection atmospheric rivers jet stream warm blob\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-ologies-最强厄尔尼诺还没到峰值-但没人活着见过它这么大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>最強厄爾尼諾還沒到峰值，但沒人活著見過它這麼大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026 年的厄爾尼諾在秋季就已超過 1982 和 2015 兩次歷史最強事件的峰值，而它的峰值通常在冬季才到。這不是未來的氣候預測，是正在發生的天氣。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣候</span><span class=\"tag\">厄爾尼諾</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How investing is getting riskier (Two Indicators) margin trading margin call single-stock leveraged ETF prediction market\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-planetmoney-保证金债务创纪录-散户正在用借来的钱炒股/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">18:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>保證金債務創紀錄，散戶正在用借來的錢炒股</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國券商保證金債務已超過全美信用卡債務總額，韓國槓桿 ETF 崩盤讓 36 萬個賬戶被強制清倉，其中多數是 35 歲以下的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">保證金交易</span><span class=\"tag\">槓桿ETF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep. 031 - EMERGENCY EPISODE: Are We Doomed? | Jordan Nanos, Doug O&#x27;Laughlin, Max Kan, Joey Brookhart neocloud backwardation P Doom RSI ROSA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-semianalysiswe-安全不是减速带-anthropic-的合规承诺反而要吃掉更多算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3f66fbf6cfa27e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">SemiAnalysis Weekly</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>安全不是減速帶：Anthropic 的合規承諾反而要吃掉更多算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dario 的「pacing the frontier」被讀成要少買卡，但 OpenAI 光思維鏈監控就花掉 20% 的算力——安全本身是算力密集型產業，需求繼續跑贏供給。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"88.在新加坡，與祥峰鄭俊聰的訪談：硬科技，下一代 Long China 與華人創新的信心史 golden share DPI Singapore Washing eVTOL AI for Science\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-lightstar-投中宇树却错过加注-耐心资本也会被基金周期卡住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccc5fa65423d3ede-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"衛\"><span class=\"dur\">2:29:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">漫談Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>投中宇樹卻錯過加註：耐心資本也會被基金週期卡住</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">祥峰2020年是宇樹Pre-A+輪唯一機構投資人，2023年那輪卻因自家美元基金到期、正在募新基金而沒錢跟投。重倉追投考驗的不只是眼光，還有基金和項目的節奏匹配。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬科技投資</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"How to Be a Double Unicorn, with John Urschel | Better in Person CTE NIL Cantor&#x27;s Diagonal argument uncountable\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-freakonomics-数学教授和nfl球员-他说自己只是运气好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/31b59d596097facf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">32:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>數學教授和NFL球員，他說自己只是運氣好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">John Urschel 一邊打NFL一邊讀完MIT數學博士，卻說天賦只佔一小部分，自己成功靠的是「極其大量的苦功」和運氣——他甚至希望橄欖球名聲沒幫他拿到MIT教職。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">職業選擇</span><span class=\"tag\">數學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E251｜推理芯片之戰：聊聊Groq、Cerebras與OpenAI三大路徑與Bill Dally的設計哲學 arithmetic intensity roofline model MFU MBU Dark silicon Amdahl&#x27;s Law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-sv101-推理芯片绕过cuda是必然-但sram的窗口未必一直开着/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>推理芯片繞過CUDA是必然，但SRAM的窗口未必一直開著</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">訓練拼算力、推理拼帶寬，Groq和Cerebras都押SRAM，但一個為確定性打折、一個為良率打折；OpenAI卻選了最貴的HBM4，因為它缺的是電不是錢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">SRAM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Luke Harding and Alastair Campbell: Trump, Putin and the New Age of Conquest (Part Two) FSB crink axis of upheaval dictator envy AFD\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-iq2-特朗普在莫斯科的档案-比任何政策分析都更能解释他的顺从/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d96b3b64117a97e0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">36:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普在莫斯科的檔案，比任何政策分析都更能解釋他的順從</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">俄羅斯情報機構對特朗普的監視從1970年代就開始了，FSB在麗思卡爾頓酒店24小時駐人。盧克·哈丁認為，這份檔案是理解特朗普對普京態度的關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span><span class=\"tag\">俄羅斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"JD Vance on AI, Entitlement Fraud, Iran War, Israel, H-1B Abuse &amp; the Midterms SNAP NIMBY DOGE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-allin-ai-前沿公司造了弗兰肯斯坦-却找政府要监管/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ff4664d500d34f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">27:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 前沿公司造了弗蘭肯斯坦，卻找政府要監管</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">萬斯說，如果你在造弗蘭肯斯坦，第一該停下來，第二當企業來要防禦工具時得給他們——而不是把前沿公司自己造的風險外包給全球治理機構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span><span class=\"tag\">H-1B</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Are Budget Airlines Facing Extinction? ULCC Basic Economy premiumization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-wsjournal-廉价航空的对手不是同行-是卖里程的信用卡生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">18:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>廉價航空的對手不是同行，是賣里程的信用卡生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">超低成本航空靠極致低價起家，如今被大航司的 Basic Economy 和常旅客信用卡夾擊——後者讓旅客願意多花 100 美元只為攢積分，價格敏感型客戶反而成了最不可靠的客戶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空業</span><span class=\"tag\">商業模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Balance of AI Power: Anton Leicht on Politics, Pacing Deals, and Muddling Through Well compute for access quasi vassalage SRO surveillance maxing muddle through\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-cogrev-暂停前沿开发对中国是笔好交易-所以美国不会接受/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f309d831f20dfbd2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:10:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>暫停前沿開發對中國是筆好交易，所以美國不會接受</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果暫停只覆蓋前沿模型開發、不覆蓋機器人、電力、半導體國產化這些賽道，中國就能把其餘全部跑完，再在失去芯片優勢的時點重啟競賽——這筆交易對美國明顯不利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>30</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 地緣政治</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Episode 199: Ken and Dawn respond to listener questions on aging, meat consumption and dementia, genetic testing, AI, exercise, a lunar mission and much more openweight APOE4 sarcopenia anabolic resistance bioelectrical impedance\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-stemtalk-近前沿模型开源后-闭源实验室的护城河还剩什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/48692e1482a92168-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">STEM-Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>近前沿模型開源後，閉源實驗室的護城河還剩什麼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果中國開源模型幾個月就能逼近美國閉源前沿，那麼「我們模型最強」就不再是護城河，真正值錢的是生態、可靠性和工作流整合。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 護城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Satya Nadella on the AI Doomer Slowdown, Microsoft&#x27;s Master Plan &amp; Who Wins AI reward hacking capability overhang KV cache harness test time compute\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-allin-微软不追前沿模型-纳德拉说真正的生意是当所有人的中间层/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0dbdd0b5b0c7b4d6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">36:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>微軟不追前沿模型：納德拉說真正的生意是當所有人的中間層</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">前沿實驗室在爭誰造最強模型，納德拉說微軟要做的是讓企業「用所有模型但獨立於所有模型」——模型層的超額利潤會被開源壓掉，錢在應用和中間層。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業AI</span><span class=\"tag\">算力投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Physical AI Learns Across Language, Video and Action — Ming-Yu Liu world model forward dynamics inverse dynamics sim-to-real gap embodiment temporal position embedding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-mlst-世界模型不是预测未来-是给机器人做排名验证/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e10a54548d7f7f00-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ML Street Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型不是預測未來，是給機器人做排名驗證</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cosmos 3 把前向動力學、逆向動力學和策略塞進一個模型，但最先落地的不是訓練，而是用神經模擬器給一堆 checkpoint 排名，篩掉大部分再上真機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Dark Matter Has a Problem. So Does MOND. MOND asymmetric drift external field effect baryonic mass kiloparsec\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-intotheimpossi-银河系外缘转慢了-暗物质和-mond-可能都预测错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b19f96d3fdc2b6b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">15:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>銀河系外緣轉慢了，暗物質和 MOND 可能都預測錯了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蓋亞測出的銀河系外緣旋轉曲線像開普勒式下降，而暗物質暈和 MOND 都預期它保持平坦——兩邊都得靠調參數或外部場效應才能活下來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">天體物理</span><span class=\"tag\">暗物質</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jacob Weisberg on the Contagion of Cowardice Profiles in Courage PEPFAR vibe shift\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-goodfight-勇气和懦弱都会传染-哈佛硬扛成了转折点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>勇氣和懦弱都會傳染，哈佛硬扛成了轉折點</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">勇氣不是個人品格，而是社會現象：人們看周圍人怎麼做。特朗普第二任期最大的變化，是身邊人從抵抗變成了投降，而哈佛拒籤協議讓抵抗重新變得可能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">機構抵抗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Age of Body Futurism | Ruby Justice Thelot paracontent body futurism quantified self GLP-1 peptides\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-a16z-肽和-glp-1-的流行-其实不是硅谷发明的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>肽和 GLP-1 的流行，其實不是硅谷發明的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">肽文化先在德州和健美圈流行，才被硅谷專業化和加速；真正值得警惕的是「關於內容的內容」比內容本身還多，讓人誤判什麼真的在發生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費文化</span><span class=\"tag\">健康科技</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Tobi Lütke: AI Agents, Better Decisions, and the Future of Work skeuomorphism slop grenades Goodhart&#x27;s law refounding event\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-knowledge-ai-不能承担责任-所以-ceo-不会被替换/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/364b2175d897a9eb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不能承擔責任，所以 CEO 不會被替換</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tobi Lütke 說機器能幫你把判斷的環境搭好，但機器不能坐牢、不能被追責。Shopify 一半的 PR 已由聊天頻道里的 AI 同事 River 發起，而人類保留的只剩品味與判斷。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">組織設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Let’s Kill Sh*t: Axios CEO on simplifying your work-life in the AI era post-processable velocity messy middle cognitive fatigue force multiplier table stakes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-masterscale-ai-短期是复杂制造机-不是效率工具/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/df59dc4c1e43fb63-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">32:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 短期是複雜製造機，不是效率工具</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 讓每個人都能寫、能做研究，結果是更多郵件、更多演示、更多決定。Jim VandeHei 說，短期它製造複雜，只有主動刪減才能拿回時間。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 效率</span><span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"How to build a secure attachment with yourself: The connection between self-worth and parenting with Dr. Marisa G. Franco secureish self-verification theory memory reconsolidation covert avoidance mere exposure effect reflective functioning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-secureattach-越想变安全-越不安全-安全型是能承认自己不安全/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">48:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>越想變安全，越不安全：安全型是能承認自己不安全</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安全型不是沒有焦慮、迴避和嫉妒，而是能當這些情緒的安全容器。把不安全的部分推開，等於在自己身上重演當年讓你不安全的批評與忽視。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依戀理論</span><span class=\"tag\">自我價值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Box&#x27;s Aaron Levie: On Reinventing Yourself in the AI Age and Enterprise Diffusion work slop harness continual learning open-weight model MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-trainingdata-模型是炼油厂-值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f7ea15b23ee6f00-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Training Data</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>模型是煉油廠，值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商業史上第一波跑出來的公司幾乎從不是下個階段的贏家。模型公司是提煉基礎油的煉油廠，真正值錢的是把智能接進銀行、藥企、政府工作流的應用層。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業AI</span><span class=\"tag\">應用層</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Doves Type Doves Type apologia photo-engraving\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-ninepi-他把整套铅字倒进泰晤士河-只为没人能用它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">37:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>他把整套鉛字倒進泰晤士河，只為沒人能用它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Thomas Cobden-Sanderson 用 173 個夜晚把 2600 磅 Doves Type 倒進泰晤士河，因為鉛字是實物，倒掉就是獨佔。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字體設計</span><span class=\"tag\">出版史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Dr. Alanna Skuse &amp; The Surgeon, The Midwife, The Quack humors apothecary quack mountebank uroscopy non-naturals\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-tpwky-文艺复兴的医生分四等-最会治病的却被叫庸医/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>文藝復興的醫生分四等，最會治病的卻被叫庸醫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">骨接師每週趕集接骨，比一年做幾例的正式外科醫生更熟練，卻被醫生罵成庸醫——頭銜和本事從來不是一回事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫學史</span><span class=\"tag\">文藝復興</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"289: Signs Your Teen is Heading Towards an Eating Disorder | Dr. Kelly Bhatnagar Maudsley family-based treatment (FBT) body neutrality disordered eating\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-asklisa-孩子开始吃得健康-可能是进食障碍的起点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e802a0f21fabf964-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">34:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>孩子開始吃得健康，可能是進食障礙的起點</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">進食障礙靠保密存活，所以家長看到苗頭就該說出口。孩子不會因此更糟，反而可能鬆一口氣——因為終於有人替她做決定了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span><span class=\"tag\">進食障礙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Don’t Let School Be the End of Play unstructured play downtime self-directed play\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-unruffled-上学不是玩的终点-自由玩耍反而更珍贵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">24:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>上學不是玩的終點，自由玩耍反而更珍貴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子進入全日制學校後，獨立、無結構的玩耍不是被取代，而是變得更稀缺、更重要——它是孩子消化學校刺激、發展創造力的核心途徑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">玩耍</span>\n</div></div></a>"]